where $ {\bf{E}}[l] = \widetilde {\bf{G}}_t^{\mathsf{H}}[l]{\bf{w}}[l]{{\bf{w}}^{\mathsf{H}}}[l]{\widetilde {\bf{G}}_t}[l] $. Thus, $ L({\bf w}[l]) $ can be approximated by $ \bar L({\bf w}[l]) $ at $ \overline {\widetilde {\bf{v}}}[l] $.
