Learning-based decision-making methods, DRL in particular, have shown promising performance in solving decision-making tasks in various applications~\cite{cobbe-2020-ppg,Mao-2017-Neural,schulman-2017-proximal,Deheng-2020-Mastering,Badnava-2023-Energy}.
