\paragraph{Implementation}
We use Stable Baselines3 (SB3) and the Imitation Learning library for PPO and behavior cloning, respectively. The LP-based demonstrations are generated from the same environment using rolling-horizon optimization with perfect foresight. The policy network is initialized from the cloned model and further trained with PPO using a clipped objective function to ensure stable convergence. This hybrid setup accelerates learning and allows the agent to generalize beyond the LP demonstrations in dynamic and uncertain scenarios.
