In summary, while significant advancements have been made in creating photorealistic avatars using Gaussian splatting and human parametric models, existing methods fall short of addressing the specific needs of VR/AR applications. The limitations in dataset customization, training efficiency, VR/AR compatibility, and detailed face and hand modeling highlight the gaps in current approaches. To address these challenges, we propose a novel end-to-end Gaussian Splatting (GS) avatar creation pipeline designed to meet the demands of VR/AR development.


\section{Method}


\begin{figure*}[htbp]
