    \caption{Histogram showing how spray droplets were categorized into small, medium and large based upon percentiles.}
    \label{fig:dropletpercentile}
\end{figure}

We also calculated the uniformity of spraying using the coefficient of variation (CV), and assessed drift by comparing the stained area in the central region of the WSP to the sides.

