These findings demonstrate that the vision guided sprayer could dynamically and consistently adjust spray output based on real time canopy information. While larger canopies received higher and more uniform spray coverage, smaller canopies were appropriately sprayed with reduced volume, minimizing overspray and improving efficiency. These results highlight the potential of AI integrated sprayer systems for precise, input optimized field applications.

