(c) SQL queries \(\{q_1, q_2, q_3\}\) generated for each gate operation in the input circuit, along with the resulting intermediate tables \(T_1, T_2\) and final output table \(T_3\).}

    \label{fig:sqlflow}
      \vspace{-0.4cm}
