	\item \textbf{Random allocation}: The RB allocation decisions are randomly set, while active beamforming and RIS reflection phase shift are optimized using the proposed algorithm.

	\item \textbf{Random RIS}: The RIS reflection phase shift are set randomly, while RB allocation decisions and BS beamforming are optimized using the proposed algorithm. Specifically, the RIS reflection phase shift are randomly selected between 0 and $\pi$.
