    \begin{itemize}
        \item $\CSP(\vec{\bC}_3^+)$ is in solvable in quadratic time for $\vec{\bP}_k$-free digraphs
        if $k\le 3$, and $\NP$-hard even for $\vec{\bP}_k$-free digraphs if $k\ge 4$, 
