	\enspace .
	\]
	We denote the intersection of the possible run sets for all participants as
	$
	I^{\mathcal{S}}(w) 
	\is 
	\Inters_{\procA \in \Procs} \globcomplocal{\mathcal{S}}{\procA}{w}
