	Let $\run$ be a run in $\globcomplocal{\mathcal{S}}{\procA}{w}$. 
	We define the longest prefix of $\run$ matching $w$:
	\[
	\alpha'
	\is
	\max
	\set{
		\run'
		\mid
		\run' \leq \run ~\wedge~
