	| \sum_{i ∈ I} \msgFromTo{\procA}{\procB_{i}}{\varphi_i.G_i}
	| \mu t. \; G
	| t
\end{grammar}\\[-3ex]
where $\procA, \procB_i \in \Procs$, $\varphi_i \in \Psi$, and $t$ ranges over a set of recursion variables. 
