	$\MsgVals(w \wproj_{\snd{\procB}{\procA}{\hole}}) > 
	\MsgVals(\SyncToAsync(\trace(\alpha \cdot s_{pre}))) \wproj_{\rcv{\procB}{\procA}{\hole}}$ and 
	$\run_\procB > \run_\procA$ follows. 
	\textit{End Proof of Claim I.}

	\noindent
