	It is clear that $s_{post} \cdot \beta$ is a maximal run in $\mathcal{S}_{s_{post}}$.  
	By \cref{lm:cc-intersection-nonemptiness-implies-prefix}, to show that a witness $v \in \pref(\lang_{s_{post}})$, it suffices to show that $v$ is channel-compliant and furthermore, that for all participants $\procD \in \Procs$, 
