In this section, we elaborate on the details of the GAN-based method proposed in this paper. In Section 2.1, we describe the principles and details of GANs. In Section 2.2, we present a surrogate training method based on reinforcement learning. In Section 2.3, we discuss the principles of machine learning models for insurance fraud detection.
